      "tag": "Play",
      "h2": "Juego — I Play",
      "body_html": "<p>For ball games use <strong>jugar</strong> + <strong>al</strong>: 'Juego <strong>al</strong> futbol', 'Juego al tenis'. Note 'al' = 'a + el' (to the).</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Do",
      "h2": "Hago — I Do",
      "body_html": "<p>For non-ball sports use <strong>hacer</strong>: 'Hago natacion' (I do swimming), 'Hago atletismo' (I do athletics).</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Time",
      "h2": "How Often",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>A veces</strong> = sometimes. <strong>Todos los dias</strong> = every day. 'Juego al futbol todos los dias' = 'I play football every day'.</p>"
    }
